  H2 asks whether the BAR is mis-scaled: it would be if `lnK` were a global
  or median value rather than per-pulsar. It is not -- `lnK` is computed
  from each pulsar's own window and its own dL_min. The columns above show
  the bar RISING with K (dL_min falls as the minimum over more combs), which
  is the opposite of a bar that fails to keep up.

